{"description": "Batch 9B-2 WikiLink / 站内链接共享语法契约。js/content-links.js 与 scripts/content_links.py 必须对同一输入给出相同的 links/markdown/diagnostics（diagnostics 只比较 reason 序列）。", "cases": [{"markdown": [], "name": "plain-wikilink", "text": "参考 [[post:rl-from-mdp-to-ppo]] 的推导。", "wikilinks": [{"display": "", "key": "post:rl-from-mdp-to-ppo"}]}, {"markdown": [], "name": "display-text", "text": "见 [[post:rl-from-mdp-to-ppo|强化学习入门]]。", "wikilinks": [{"display": "强化学习入门", "key": "post:rl-from-mdp-to-ppo"}]}, {"markdown": [], "name": "display-trim", "text": "[[post:abc-def|  带空格显示  ]]", "wikilinks": [{"display": "带空格显示", "key": "post:abc-def"}]}, {"markdown": [], "name": "display-special-chars", "text": "[[post:abc|含\"引号\"与<标签>&符号]]", "wikilinks": [{"display": "含\"引号\"与<标签>&符号", "key": "post:abc"}]}, {"markdown": [], "name": "adjacent-wikilinks", "text": "[[post:aaa]][[post:bbb|乙]]", "wikilinks": [{"display": "", "key": "post:aaa"}, {"display": "乙", "key": "post:bbb"}]}, {"markdown": [], "name": "duplicate-wikilink-dedup", "text": "[[post:aaa]] 再来 [[post:aaa|别名]]", "wikilinks": [{"display": "", "key": "post:aaa"}]}, {"diagnostics": ["invalid-wikilink"], "markdown": [], "name": "invalid-id-uppercase", "text": "[[post:Abc]]", "wikilinks": []}, {"diagnostics": ["invalid-wikilink"], "markdown": [], "name": "invalid-id-underscore", "text": "[[post:abc_def]]", "wikilinks": []}, {"diagnostics": ["invalid-wikilink"], "markdown": [], "name": "invalid-id-chinese", "text": "[[post:中文文章]]", "wikilinks": []}, {"diagnostics": ["invalid-wikilink"], "markdown": [], "name": "empty-display", "text": "[[post:abc|]]", "wikilinks": []}, {"diagnostics": ["invalid-wikilink"], "markdown": [], "name": "display-with-pipe", "text": "[[post:abc|a|b]]", "wikilinks": []}, {"diagnostics": ["invalid-wikilink"], "markdown": [], "name": "unclosed-wikilink", "text": "[[post:abc 没有闭合", "wikilinks": []}, {"diagnostics": ["unsupported-type"], "markdown": [], "name": "unsupported-course-type-with-pipe-id", "text": "[[course:本科课程|机器人与自动化-(CS422)]]", "wikilinks": []}, {"diagnostics": ["unsupported-type"], "markdown": [], "name": "unsupported-paper-type", "text": "[[paper:paper-13]]", "wikilinks": []}, {"markdown": [], "name": "fenced-code-backtick", "text": "前文\n```\n[[post:inside-fence]]\n[链接](#/post/also-inside)\n```\n后文 [[post:real-one]]", "wikilinks": [{"display": "", "key": "post:real-one"}]}, {"markdown": [], "name": "fenced-code-tilde", "text": "~~~\n[[post:inside-tilde]]\n~~~\n[[post:outside]]", "wikilinks": [{"display": "", "key": "post:outside"}]}, {"markdown": [], "name": "fence-with-language", "text": "```markdown\n[[post:demo]]\n```\n[[post:ok]]", "wikilinks": [{"display": "", "key": "post:ok"}]}, {"markdown": [], "name": "inline-code", "text": "行内 `[[post:code-span]]` 不解析，[[post:yes]] 解析。", "wikilinks": [{"display": "", "key": "post:yes"}]}, {"markdown": [], "name": "inline-code-double-backtick", "text": "``[[post:code2]]`` 与 [[post:ok2]]", "wikilinks": [{"display": "", "key": "post:ok2"}]}, {"markdown": [], "name": "escaped-brackets", "text": "\\[\\[post:escaped]] 与 [[post:fine]]", "wikilinks": [{"display": "", "key": "post:fine"}]}, {"markdown": [], "name": "html-tag-attribute", "text": "<a title=\"[[post:in-attr]]\">x</a> [[post:out]]", "wikilinks": [{"display": "", "key": "post:out"}]}, {"markdown": [{"key": "post:target", "raw": "#/post/target"}], "name": "markdown-internal-link", "text": "看 [目标文章](#/post/target)。", "wikilinks": []}, {"markdown": [{"key": "post:target", "raw": "#/post/target"}], "name": "markdown-html-href", "text": "<a href=\"#/post/target\">目标</a>", "wikilinks": []}, {"markdown": [{"key": "course:本科课程|机器人与自动化-(CS422)", "raw": "#/course/%E6%9C%AC%E7%A7%91%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%7C%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8E%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96-(CS422)"}], "name": "markdown-encoded-course-link", "text": "[机器人课](#/course/%E6%9C%AC%E7%A7%91%E8%AF%BE%E7%A8%8B%7C%E6%9C%BA%E5%99%A8%E4%BA%BA%E4%B8%8E%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%8C%96-(CS422))", "wikilinks": []}, {"markdown": [{"key": "paper:paper-13", "raw": "#/papers?kind=paper&target=paper-13"}], "name": "markdown-papers-query", "text": "[论文](#/papers?kind=paper&target=paper-13)", "wikilinks": []}, {"markdown": [{"key": "material:lm-000001", "raw": "#/papers?kind=material&target=lm-000001"}], "name": "markdown-material-query", "text": "[资料](#/papers?kind=material&target=lm-000001)", "wikilinks": []}, {"markdown": [], "name": "external-link-ignored", "text": "[外部](https://example.com/post/x) [锚点](#section)", "wikilinks": []}, {"markdown": [{"key": "post:bbb", "raw": "#/post/bbb"}], "name": "wikilink-in-link-text", "text": "[见 [[post:aaa]]](#/post/bbb)", "wikilinks": [{"display": "", "key": "post:aaa"}]}, {"markdown": [], "name": "wikilink-in-link-destination-ignored", "text": "[x](https://example.com/[[post:dest]])", "wikilinks": []}, {"markdown": [{"key": "post:dup", "raw": "#/post/dup"}], "name": "duplicate-markdown-dedup", "text": "[a](#/post/dup) 又 [b](#/post/dup)", "wikilinks": []}, {"markdown": [{"key": "lib:pythoncodeplace", "raw": "#/codelib/pythoncodeplace"}], "name": "mixed-wikilink-and-markdown", "text": "[[post:aaa]] 与 [库](#/codelib/pythoncodeplace)", "wikilinks": [{"display": "", "key": "post:aaa"}]}, {"markdown": [], "name": "crlf-line-endings", "text": "```\r\n[[post:in-fence]]\r\n```\r\n[[post:out-fence]]", "wikilinks": [{"display": "", "key": "post:out-fence"}]}], "schemaVersion": 1}